        "text": "RUSSELL\nNUMO\nAbout\nProjects\nContact\nFRONTEND DEVELOPER\nFRONTEND DEVELOPER\nFRONTEND DEVELOPER\nFRONTEND DEVELOPER\nUX/UI DESIGNER\nUX/UI DESIGNER\nUX/UI DESIGNER\nUX/UI DESIGNER\nCREATIVE\nCREATIVE\nCREATIVE\nCREATIVE\nCREATIVE\nCREATIVE\n\n BASED IN AMSTERDAM \n\n20:17:15\n\nOPEN TO WORK\n\n(01)\n\nABOUT\n\nI design and develop digital experiences with a focus on craft, motion, and\ninteraction — creating interfaces where every detail is intentional.\n\nBased in Amsterdam, I work at the intersection of creativity and technology. From\nconcept to code, I bring ideas to life with meticulous attention to detail.\n\nFEATURED WORK\n\n[SCROLL TO EXPLORE MORE]\n\n(01)\n\nRESEARCHER & DEVELOPMENT\n\n2026\n\nSTADSARCHIEF\nAMSTERDAM\n\nA look at how archival content can be experienced\nthrough interaction and storytelling, reimagining the\nStadsarchief Amsterdam as a living, engaging digital\nspace.\n\n(02)\n\nDESIGN & DEVELOPMENT\n\n2024\n\nDEPT®\n\nWorked on the Dept Campus website from concept to\nlaunch, building a streamlined and engaging experience\nthat helps young professionals discover and navigate\nopportunities.\n\n\"The web is loud, and most brands just blend into it. I work across design, development, and branding all at once, building digital experiences that feel as sharp as they look. Nothing gets handed off between teams or lost in translation, because I build every layer myself. That's how the identity we create together actually holds up once it's live. If your brand deserves to be seen, let's make sure people can't look away."
